# TAB-separated: <relative path under dev HOME> <absolute host path>
# Keep this file untracked. Link only the auth/session material the CLI
# absolutely needs; let configs, memory files, MCP config, and blackbox
# state stay isolated inside ./.dev-agent/home.
#
# examples:
# .claude/.credentials.json	/home/invidious/.claude/.credentials.json
# .codex/auth.json	/home/invidious/.codex/auth.json
# .gemini/oauth.json	/home/invidious/.gemini/oauth.json
